{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》除了有視帝視后級人馬，一眾新生代小花亦相當搶鏡！當中，港姐出身的陳星妤（Yvette）飾演陳自瑤女兒寶兒，為配合角色男仔頭性格及實習醫生身份，刻意以Boyish造型上陣。昨晚她更獻出首次打戲初體驗，為求完美效果私下做足準備，獲讚相當專業！\n</p>\n<h2>陳星妤獻首次打戲 為擒賊人做足準備</h2>\n<p>昨晚一集，陳星妤迎來了演藝生涯的首次打戲挑戰。雖然只是一場簡單的擒拿賊人戲份，但為了配合角色「睇得又打得」的設定，Yvette事前及拍攝現場都做足準備。從現場花絮片可見，即使是一個簡單的轉身動作，她都跟隨武術指導認真地反覆練習，轉完又轉，務求拍出來的效果自然流暢，而非「姐手姐腳」，其認真及專業的態度值得一讚。</p>\n<h2>陳星妤親解Boyish造型：醫生好忙唔會太注重打扮</h2>\n<p>對於劇中多以Oversize Style短打造型示人，陳星妤受訪時親自解畫，透露Boyish造型是為了呼應角色寶兒的男仔頭性格。她解釋：「仲有通常醫生（寶兒乃實習醫生）好忙都唔會太注重打扮，加上佢又好動，所以都係運動造型同埋casualwear多。」可見她對角色有深入的理解，並非單純跟從劇組安排，而是由內到外塑造一個立體的角色。</p>\n<h2>港姐出身演活男仔頭 擁MMA跆拳道底子</h2>\n<p>陳星妤飾演的寶兒在外國長大，角色設定本身擁有MMA、跆拳道及詠春等功夫底子，這也為她首次挑戰打戲提供了合理的背景。這位港姐出身的小花，放下靚女包袱，以清爽的男仔頭形象示人，成功演活了實習醫生的爽朗與幹勁，讓觀眾看到她作為演員的可塑性，期待她未來在劇中展現更多「打得」的一面。</p>\n<h2>網民讚專業：期待打女新星！</h2>\n<p>雖然是首次拍攝打戲，但陳星妤的認真態度已獲網民留意及稱讚。不少觀眾看好她的潛力，紛紛留言表示支持：「新人嚟講算好認真！」、「個男仔頭造型幾襯佢」、「睇得出有用心準備角色」、「期待佢之後嘅打戲！唔好嘥咗個設定」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_8492012786af5431d848f2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_8492012786af5431d848f2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_11845051566af5434398431.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_11845051566af5434398431.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_1722024656af5434aa1e16.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_1722024656af5434aa1e16.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_15916150856af5434de3fda.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_15916150856af5434de3fda.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_5086507076af5435154b06.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_5086507076af5435154b06.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_14146989156af543548787a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_14146989156af543548787a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15b_12484016156af5435b2fc7e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15b_12484016156af5435b2fc7e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15a_17656572186af5435e983ab.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15a_17656572186af5435e983ab.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_11899373006af54361ea575.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_11899373006af54361ea575.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_13988502506af5432c9d3ca.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_13988502506af5432c9d3ca.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_13142686026af543331eb38.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_13142686026af543331eb38.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09b_12555839826af5433681b3c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09b_12555839826af5433681b3c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09a_15521209516af5433a44711.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09a_15521209516af5433a44711.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_5006246166af5433d63c47.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_5006246166af5433d63c47.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T06:44:30.449679+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1143,"images":14,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T06:30:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T06:38:02.956134+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T06:38:02.956134+00:00","content_hash":"754e297b8cdd55ac45d16f8b004bb5dbec7f863446f395578e449a752e2fc563","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"con